# ── Secrets — NEVER commit (added 2026-08-02, [SEC-KEYS-1]) ────────────────
# `keys/` holds Google service-account JSON with live `private_key` values
# (Play billing + closed-testers accounts). They were untracked but NOT
# ignored, so `git status` listed them as addable. This repo is worked by
# several agents at once and `git_safe_commit.py` still supports its legacy
# no-paths form, which runs `git add -A` — one such commit would have pushed
# both private keys to GitHub. Untracked is not the same as safe.
keys/
*service-account*.json
*-service-account.json
gha-creds-*.json

