# [ENV-ISOLATION-1] Per-machine staging/prod marker read by scripts/cf.sh.
# NEVER commit: committing "prod" would make production the default for every
# clone and every agent. Absent => cf.sh falls back to the branch (main => prod,
# which is fail-closed behind ALLOW_PROD=1 anyway).
.avatok-target

